# Luxel library sprite — original art, Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# The strip cut of `bulb-string`: four C9 bulbs — red, green, blue, gold — one
# pixel each with a dark gap between, 8x1 so it tiles along a strip of any
# length (library/README.md "Strips"). Two frames trade which pair glows: red
# and blue lit while green and gold dim, then the other way round. The gaps
# are transparent, so whatever is beneath shows as the wire.
name: Bulb String 8x1
fps: 1
palette:
  R ff2a2a
  G 2aff5a
  B 2a6bff
  Y ffcc2a
  r 5a0e0e
  g 0e5a1e
  b 0e245a
  y 5a480e

frame
R.g.B.y.

frame
r.G.b.Y.
